---
title: Simple Iced Caramel Macchiato
image: https://dinnerthendessert.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Caramel-Macchiato-10.jpg
time required: 5 minutes
servings: 1
---

Prepare @espresso{2%shots}(can substitute with 2 tsp insta coffee). Set aside.

Line your cup with @caramel sauce{1%tsp}. 

Add @vanilla syrup{1%tbsp}(2 Torani pumps), @ice{1%handful}, and @milk{3/4%cup}.

Mix in the coffee and top with additional @?caramel sauce{} as desired.